{%- doc -%}
  Eagle & Ash, 27 Oct 2026: the gift answer under "Why it's different" (Anu: the FAQ answer "Is it a good gift for a
  golfer?" deserves a place there; the heading is the line "Golf gifts that beat another dozen balls" from the Shop
  page drafts). Text = product metafield custom.gift_note; nothing is shown when it is empty.
  2 Nov 2026 (Anu: "love all the proposals"): a joke per product as the heading (custom.gift_heading, empty = the
  title below) and a line for the gift card at the end of the box (custom.gift_card_line, empty = no line). 3 Nov: label 'Adding a message? Stuck for words? Borrow this:' (Anu: must not sound as if a card is included; a bit funny; not 'gift card', which means a store card in the US).

  @param {object} product - The product.
  @param {string} title - Heading; words between two stars are shown in orange.
{%- enddoc -%}
{%- assign ea_text = product.metafields.custom.gift_note.value -%}
{%- assign ea_title = product.metafields.custom.gift_heading.value | default: title -%}
{%- assign ea_card_line = product.metafields.custom.gift_card_line.value -%}
{%- if ea_text != blank -%}
  <div class="ea-gift-note">
    <h2 class="ea-gift-note__title">{%- render 'ea-accent-text', text: ea_title -%}</h2>
    <p class="ea-gift-note__text">{{ ea_text | escape | newline_to_br }}</p>
    {%- if ea_card_line != blank -%}
      <p class="ea-gift-note__card">
        <span class="ea-gift-note__card-label">Adding a message? Stuck for words? Borrow this:</span>
        <span class="ea-gift-note__card-line">“{{ ea_card_line | escape }}”</span>
      </p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  /* The custom-liquid block's wrapper would otherwise shrink to the text width in the column layout. */
  div:has(> .ea-gift-note) {
    width: 100%;
  }

  /* Same light grey as the top of the "What golfers say" section. */
  .ea-gift-note {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 56px auto 0;
    padding: 36px 24px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: #f7f8f8;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ea-gift-note__title {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .ea-gift-note__text {
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* the line for the gift card: a short orange rule above it, the label in the small-text orange #b83a00 (5.4:1 on
     the grey), the line itself in the heading font */
  .ea-gift-note__card {
    margin: 24px auto 0;
    padding-block-start: 20px;
    max-width: 520px;
    text-wrap: balance;
    background: linear-gradient(#fd5000, #fd5000) top center / 36px 2px no-repeat;
  }

  .ea-gift-note__card-label {
    display: block;
    margin-block-end: 4px;
    color: #b83a00;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ea-gift-note__card-line {
    font-family: var(--font-heading--family);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ea-gift-note {
      padding: 48px 64px;
    }

    .ea-gift-note__title {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}
